  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\"><b>과학수업 만들기&gt;</b>의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의&nbsp;<b>'협업'</b>을 위해<b>&nbsp;공유</b>되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</u></span></b></span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px dashed rgb(121, 165, 228); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(219, 232, 251);\"><p><b style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">#온라인 수업#유전 #중3</span></b></p></div><p><br></p></div><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&lt;비상교과서&gt; </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">5. 생식과 유전</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;①&nbsp;혀말기 가계도 해석하기</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; : </span><a href=\"https://www.liveworksheets.com/c?a=s&amp;t=bshed6vrnf&amp;l=od&amp;i=udddccn&amp;r=yo&amp;db=1\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">https://www.liveworksheets.com/c?a=s&amp;t=bshed6vrnf&amp;l=od&amp;i=udddccn&amp;r=yo&amp;db=1</span></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;